window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Burned. Destroyed. Dead.</b></p> <p>Everything was gone.</p> <p>I'd found a home here. I'd finally found a place where I belonged. And they'd stolen that from me.</p> <p>Odin may think he was winning, but he couldn't be more wrong.</p> <p>Because he'd made a mistake. He'd left me alive, and I was going to make him pay.</p> <p>Revenge would be mine. And once I was finished, the only blood running through the streets of Asgard would belong to the gods.</p>"; 
